  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Cross-cutting — the 5 skills every group leans on",
      "items": [
        "xlsx-author — any workbook via officecli: blue/black/green, formulas not hardcodes, crore by formula, view-issues gate",
        "pptx-author — any deck: one idea per slide, numbers footnoted to a cell, screenshot + outline QA",
        "audit-xls — pre-delivery: formula errors, hidden hardcodes, broken links, BS balance and cash tie",
        "india-market-conventions + india-market-data — FY, units, Ind AS, SEBI LODR, free source inventory"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Where they overlap",
      "items": [
        "Valuation three times: comps-analysis (peers), dcf-model (intrinsic), returns-analysis (cash-on-cash) — one model layer, three questions",
        "Equity research ships twice: 9 workflow vs 11 source skills; earnings-preview vs -beta is one task at two depths",
        "ic-memo, pitch-deck and cim-builder assemble the same exhibits — only the narrative differs",
        "Fund admin (6) and KYC (2) sit outside the overlay: the ERP already runs in India"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Use cases, and the gaps we name instead of filling",
      "items": [
        "Value a company — dcf-model on live CCIL 9Y-10Y, beta vs NIFTY 50, cross-checked with comps-analysis; pre-earnings — earnings-preview-beta or -preview, then earnings-analysis",
        "Sell-side — datapack-builder, pitch-deck, cim-builder, teaser; fund a deal — deal-screening, dd-checklist, returns-analysis, ic-memo; month-end — accruals, roll-forward, gl-recon, nav-tieout",
        "Six gaps stay open and are named, not filled: private funding, pledge series, SENSEX constituents, MOSPI monthly, segments, credit spreads",
        "CCIL gives live G-sec but no history; yfinance consensus is thin on small caps — both stated in-skill"
      ]
    }
  ]
